{
  "$schema": "https://unpkg.com/syncpack@15.3.3/dist/schema.json",
  "dev": true,
  "sortPackages": true,
  "semverGroups": [
    {
      "label": "Biome is pinned: a patch release has previously changed Svelte formatting output.",
      "packages": ["@biomejs/biome"],
      "range": "2.5.13"
    },
    {
      "//": [
        "TypeScript is pinned, and only `typescript`.",
        "",
        "`@typescript/native-preview` was in this group and was the second",
        "reason this group existed — `tsgo --noEmit` ran eight of the eleven",
        "typecheck tasks. It is a `7.0.0-dev` prerelease (latest as of",
        "2026-10-02, and the pin was already two months old), and a group that",
        "pins `6.0.3` cannot hold a `7.0.0-dev` range: the two could never",
        "both be satisfied, so the group documented an impossibility rather",
        "than a constraint.",
        "",
        "The typecheck tasks run `tsc --noEmit` now. `svelte-check` stays for",
        "the two Svelte projects, because it is the only one that type-checks a",
        "component; `tsc` cannot. See docs/toolchain.md."
      ],
      "label": "TypeScript is pinned: vtsls and every typecheck task track this major.",
      "packages": ["typescript"],
      "range": "6.0.3"
    }
  ]
}
